1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,067
Rule one. Arrive before sunset. The
gate closes at seven. No exceptions.

2
00:00:05,767 --> 00:00:10,200
Six fifty-seven. The wall grows from a
gray line into a mountain of concrete.

3
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:17,233
Forty feet high. Floodlights.
Watchtowers. And one lamp over the
gate, burning all by itself.

4
00:00:17,933 --> 00:00:20,433
Six fifty-nine. The gate starts to
close.

5
00:00:21,133 --> 00:00:23,067
Wait! Wait! I'm coming!

6
00:00:23,767 --> 00:00:29,033
Gate's closing, stranger. Hands where
I can see them. And slow down, or I'll
slow you down.

7
00:00:29,733 --> 00:00:34,267
You throw the bicycle through the gap.
The gate slams. Seven o'clock exactly.

8
00:00:34,967 --> 00:00:37,633
Four seconds. I made it by four
seconds.
